From 781468ebfd04484d17337caab46d6d25b0e13e2c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keenni <Keenni@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:21:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] =?UTF-8?q?learn(1/n):=20dsv41=20--learn=20stage=201?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E2=80=94=20kept=20state=20on=20disk=20with=20its=20extent's?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20compressed=20rows?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- model: extentBytes/extentCopy (the compressed plane of one extent, host<->device)
- lanes: snapWriteFn/snapReadFn/snapForgetFn + learn_write/learn_read/learn_forget wire frames
  (each rank writes its own <key>.r<rank>.bin; header pins chunk_rows/window/streams/at/pool, sha256 whole)
- native/cuda: the three hooks wired into the prompt cache's Snapshots
- prompt_cache: learn() charges the file's bytes (disk_bytes hook), not the slot's storage
---
 zig/src/core/prompt_cache.zig     |  11 +-
 zig/src/families/dsv41/lanes.zig  | 249 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 zig/src/families/dsv41/model.zig  |  50 ++++++
 zig/src/families/dsv41/native.zig |  20 ++-
 zig/src/native/cuda.zig           |  11 +-
 5 files changed, 335 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

